WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:06.000
Your son would never dare coerce Imperial Father. Every thought I harbor is solely for Great Xuan.

00:06.680 --> 00:11.200
Since antiquity, loyalty and filial piety have been one. To serve one's sovereign without loyalty is, in itself, unfilial.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.600
You haven't visited the palace in quite some time. Accompany Zhen in a game of Weiqi.

00:23.760 --> 00:25.000
As Imperial Father commands.
